terraform uptimerobot monitor

## Usage

```hcl
  module ""main"" {
    source = ""hadenlabs/monitor/uptimerobot""
    version   = ""0.1.0""
    monitors = [
      {
        friendly_name = ""test-url""
        url           = ""https://google.com""
      },
    ]
  }

```

Full working examples can be found in [examples](./examples) folder.

