| columns | (Optional) The names of the columns. | `list(string)` | <pre>[<br> ""Backlog"",<br> ""To Do"",<br> ""Do Today"",<br> ""In Progress"",<br> ""In Review"",<br> ""Approved"",<br> ""Done""<br>]</pre> | no |
| name | The name of the project. | `string` | n/a | yes |

