Essential UI components for building hospital management interfaces.

## Usage

Add components from this registry using the shadcn CLI:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add ""https://Railly.github.io/hospital-ui/r/{component-name}.json""
```

Or configure as a namespace in your `components.json`:

```json
{
  ""registries"": {
    ""hospital-ui"": {
      ""url"": ""https://Railly.github.io/hospital-ui/r""
    }
  }
}
```

Then install components by name:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add hospital-ui/{component-name}
```

## Development

Build the registry locally:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest registry:build
```

Built files will be output to `public/r/`.

## Deployment

This registry auto-deploys to GitHub Pages on every push to `main`.

Registry URL: https://Railly.github.io/hospital-ui

---

