## Functions

Zsh issues includes a small utility `issues` to fetch and install new packages.

#### `issues::install`

Install issues.

#### `issues::load`

Load path issues.

#### `issues::list`

Show issues.

#### `issues::search` `task`

Search task.

#### `issues::task::create` `task`

Create issue.

#### `issues::task::feat` `task`

Create issue type feature.

#### `issues::task::fix` `task`

Create issue type fix.

