https://api.github.com/repos/marco-soria/261025pizzeriatailwind/deployments,2025-10-26T13:53:52Z,2026-01-21T10:09:15Z,2025-10-26T14:17:58Z,git://github.com/marco-soria/261025pizzeriatailwind.git,git@github.com:marco-soria/261025pizzeriatailwind.git,https://github.com/marco-soria/261025pizzeriatailwind.git,https://github.com/marco-soria/261025pizzeriatailwind,,3177,0,0,HTML,True,True,True,True,False,False,0,,False,False,0,,True,False,False,True,all,[],public,0,0,0,main,"{'admin': False, 'maintain': False, 'push': False, 'triage': False, 'pull': True}",,"# Bella Italia Pizzeria

A modern, responsive pizzeria website built with Angular 20 and Tailwind CSS.

## 🚀 Tech Stack

- **Angular 20** - Latest Angular with standalone components
- **Tailwind CSS 4** - Utility-first CSS framework
- **TypeScript 5.9** - Type-safe JavaScript
- **PNPM** - Fast, disk space efficient package manager

## 📁 Project Structure

```
src/app/
├── pages/                    # Feature pages (lazy loaded)
│   ├── home/                # Home page component
│   └── menu/                # Menu page component
├── shared/                  # Shared resources
│   ├── components/          # Reusable components
│   │   ├── header/         # Header navigation
│   │   ├── footer/         # Footer
│   │   └── product-card/   # Product card component
│   ├── models/             # TypeScript interfaces
│   └── data/               # Static data (menu items)
├── app.ts                  # Root component
├── app.routes.ts           # Route configuration
└── app.config.ts           # App configuration
```

## 🎯 Features

- **Standalone Components** - Using Angular's latest standalone API
- **Modern Syntax** - Using `@for`, `@if` control flow (no ngFor/ngIf)
- **Lazy Loading** - Routes are lazy loaded for better performance
- **Typed Data** - Strongly typed models for products and categories
- **Responsive Design** - Mobile-first responsive layout
- **Signal Inputs** - Using Angular's signal-based inputs for better reactivity

## 🛠️ Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 18 or higher
- PNPM 8 or higher

### Installation

```bash
# Install dependencies
pnpm install
```

### Development

```bash
# Start development server
pnpm start
# or
pnpm run ng serve

# Navigate to http://localhost:4200/
```

### Build

```bash
# Build for production
pnpm run build

# Output will be in dist/ folder
```

### Testing

```bash
# Run unit tests
pnpm test
```

## 📝 Component Guide

### Product Card Component

Reusable component for displaying product information with pricing:

```typescript
<app-product-card [product]=""pizza"" />
```

### Header Component

Smart header that changes content based on current page:

```typescript
<app-header [isMenuPage]=""true"" />
```

## 🎨 Styling

The project uses Tailwind CSS 4 with custom configuration. Main theme colors:

- **Primary**: Red/Pizza theme color
- **Background**: Light gray background
- Custom font families for headers

## 📄 License

All rights reserved © 2025 BellaItalia Pizzeria

## 🌐 Pages

- **Home** (`/`) - Landing page with featured pizzas, gallery, and locations
